 "lead_html": "<p><b>Pyrelands art pass, 2026-10-14 (PYRELANDS_SHIP_READINESS_1).</b> Each row: the NEW render (pyr_* job) beside the vanilla stand-in the game draws today. Nothing is installed: pick a column, and install follows your picks (new texPaths + def edits).</p><ul><li>Corpses: derived from each creature's own living art (same pose and footprint), bleached and hollowed. Vanilla's stand-ins are grey skeletons of other animals.</li><li>Breaker core: today the item is vanilla ComponentIndustrial tinted (230,220,160); the new sprite carries its own colour, so install drops the tint.</li><li>Breaker _Off: the def tints the building (230,200,120) for both frames; RM_LightningBreaker.cs already loads <code>_Off</code> when it exists, no C# change needed.</li><li>Barbslinger spike: install adds an RM_ projectile def (today the tail gun fires Biotech's Bullet_ToxicNeedleGun).</li></ul>",
 "ground_terrain": "RM_FE_Ash_Deep"
}